msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Yes, I need healing. " or "I need healing. "
msgctxt "bark 0419:302D"
msgid "I would that I could heal you, but a terrible thing has happened. I am not able to touch Stratos. I am afraid something dreadful has happened. "
