#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Yes, I need healing. " or "I need healing. "
msgctxt "bark 0419:30FA"
msgid "Now that my Focus has been returned to me, I will be able to perform the healing rites upon you. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Yes, I need healing. " or "I need healing. "
