msgid "Please leave me now, I need to rest. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Yes, I need healing. " or "I need healing. "
msgctxt "bark 0419:31A6"
msgid "I would heal you, but you are perfectly healthy! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Yes, I need healing. " or "I need healing. "
